   $q$What does Mrs. Abernathy's response most reasonably suggest?$q$, $q$[{"text":"She had already decided on a tie and asked Kenji only as a courtesy.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"She found his reasoning credible and let it shape the official result.","is_correct":true},{"text":"She doubted Kenji's honesty and checked his watches before deciding.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"She was annoyed that Kenji could not give her a clear winner.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$She found his reasoning credible and let it shape the official result.$q$, $q$She studies him, nods, writes on her clipboard, and the board soon announces a tie, which matches his recommendation. The text never says she checked his watches or had decided beforehand, so those readings add events that are not there.$q$, 'draft', 'af5efd6f-5f04-5752-b0f7-8613cd7984a3')
