   $q$Evaluate the effectiveness of ending the passage with a one-sentence paragraph:$q$, $q$[{"text":"It is effective, because it recasts the \"clutter\" of the opening as useful, tying ending to beginning.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It is ineffective, because a single sentence is too short to count as a conclusion.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overgeneralization"},{"text":"It is effective, because it lists the steps Adeyemi followed in her investigation.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"not-in-text"},{"text":"It is ineffective, because it introduces a new claim that the passage never supports.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It is effective, because it recasts the "clutter" of the opening as useful, tying ending to beginning.$q$, $q$The "flaw in the equipment" recalls the signal staff dismissed as clutter, and paragraph 4 already showed its usefulness, so the short line states the insight with emphasis. It adds no unsupported claim.$q$, 'draft', '83c57c22-fcfa-560b-9e2a-ffe9cd86355d')
