  ('e3d3c0a1-df35-5881-932e-c2cc157b7bfb', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g12-theme-summary'), null, 'easy',
   $q$Which statement best expresses a central theme of the passage?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Competing with integrity can cost a victory but earns a deeper kind of respect.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Athletes who train for two years deserve to reach the final of their tournament.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"Honesty in sports is foolish because it only helps one's opponents win.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"ignores-ending"},{"text":"Fencing equipment should be tested carefully before every tournament begins.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"topic-not-theme"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Competing with integrity can cost a victory but earns a deeper kind of respect.$q$, $q$Marisol's honesty costs her the bout, yet Freya's handshake and Marisol's final line show respect and self-respect remain. The passage does not treat honesty as foolish; Marisol does not regret it.$q$, 'draft', '66abf76b-c2d5-521f-bd75-08325eac49d5')
