  ('787745ea-005c-59bf-acc1-8a18180f7b87', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g12-theme-summary'), null, 'easy',
   $q$Which choice is the best objective summary of the passage?$q$, $q$[{"text":"When a faulty machine misses her opponent's touch, Marisol reports it, loses the semifinal, and is later honored by the winner's handshake.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Marisol reports a missed touch, the referee ignores her, and she wins the final anyway.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"Marisol bravely and admirably sacrifices her dream so that a less skilled fencer can win.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"includes-opinion"},{"text":"A technician wiggles the cables on a scoring machine during a fencing tournament.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$When a faulty machine misses her opponent's touch, Marisol reports it, loses the semifinal, and is later honored by the winner's handshake.$q$, $q$The correct choice gives the key events in order without judgment. Calling her act admirable and Freya less skilled adds opinion, and Marisol did not win.$q$, 'draft', '66abf76b-c2d5-521f-bd75-08325eac49d5')
