        '3-5', $q$Swimming in Gym Class$q$, $q$(1) Our town has a lake, two rivers, and a public pool. (2) I believe every fourth grader should take swimming lessons during gym class. (3) Knowing how to swim helps kids stay safe near water. (4) Swimmers learn how to float and how to reach the edge of a pool. (5) Swimming is also great exercise. (6) It works the arms, the legs, and the heart all at the same time.

(7) The town pool is only a short bus ride from our school. (8) Some kids already took lessons, but many families cannot pay for them. (9) ______ lessons at school would give every student a fair chance to learn. (10) My older brother likes jumping off the diving board.$q$, 'draft')
